   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "Deployment defaults: hardcoded in src\\main.cpp\n  HOST 192.168.70.2    IG 192.168.70.70\n  --host-ip / --host-port / --ig-ip / --ig-port\n  exist for a bench test only; the deployment\n  passes none of them",
   "originalText": "Deployment defaults: hardcoded in src\\main.cpp\n  HOST 192.168.70.2    IG 192.168.70.70\n  --host-ip / --host-port / --ig-ip / --ig-port\n  exist for a bench test only; the deployment\n  passes none of them",
   "textAlign": "left",
