  },
  {
   "id": "G0qvOHWVudQ1aOpEdoRG",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 450.0,
   "width": 883.4000000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1851360959,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 323941097,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "The HOST is a request/response slave: it sends nothing until the IG sends a Start-of-Frame. Each SOF is answered with one datagram\ncarrying:",
   "originalText": "The HOST is a request/response slave: it sends nothing until the IG sends a Start-of-Frame. Each SOF is answered with one datagram\ncarrying:",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 14
  },
  {
   "id": "7V53zTx8YoJ1rv3mxwDO",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 505.0,
   "width": 558.0,
   "height": 46.875,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 982603072,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1178529387,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "IG Control x1 - Entity Control x3 - HAT/HOT Request x1 - View Control x1\nArticulated Part Control x5 - Rate Control x8\nAtmosphere Control x1 (first frames only, warm-up)",
   "originalText": "IG Control x1 - Entity Control x3 - HAT/HOT Request x1 - View Control x1\nArticulated Part Control x5 - Rate Control x8\nAtmosphere Control x1 (first frames only, warm-up)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "ZE5YRLtmkOAjF5a8w091",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 580.0,
   "width": 830.7600000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1123622865,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1508282127,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "The SOF echoes the HOST's own frame counter at offset 8 - never a count of the SOFs the IG sent - so the outgoing SOF stays\nbyte-identical to the reference Master's.",
   "originalText": "The SOF echoes the HOST's own frame counter at offset 8 - never a count of the SOFs the IG sent - so the outgoing SOF stays\nbyte-identical to the reference Master's.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 14
  },
  {
   "id": "AYcOlftxIUqiTVg5bIn2",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 60.0,
   "y": 760.0,
   "width": 1080.0,
   "height": 840.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "dashed",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1822594513,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1493790124,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "LtKc9zyI9HZPQk9GgfjU",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 74.0,
   "y": 770.0,
   "width": 465.31,
   "height": 23.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 835826011,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 716421904,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "3 - Protocol and wire layout (CIGI 3.3, little-endian)",
   "originalText": "3 - Protocol and wire layout (CIGI 3.3, little-endian)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "JqtcVLQYmk5ssIswiymV",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 820.0,
   "width": 620.0,
   "height": 234.375,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1352522814,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 20291202,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "framing: [id 1B][size 1B][payload]    size = total bytes incl. header\n\nSOF   id 101 (0x65), 24 bytes\n  65 18 03 00 00 b5 00 80 <frame counter> 00 00 00 00 00 .. 00   the reference\n  65 18 03 00 00 30 00 80 <frame counter> 00 00 00 00 00 .. 00   this IG\n     |        |  |\n     |        |  +-- 0x00 0x80 at bytes 6-7: the byte-swap flag (little-endian)\n     |        +----- byte 5: IG mode (bits 0-1), timestamp-valid (2), earth\n     |                 model (3), CIGI minor version (4-7); 3.3 => 0x30\n     +-------------- byte 0: id (0x65), byte 1: size (0x18 = 24 bytes)\n  offset 8: the HOST's frame counter, echoed out of the IG Control it arrived in\n  offsets 12 / 16: timestamp and last-host-frame - left at 0 by the reference\n  Master, still 0 here, which is what keeps the SOF byte-identical\n  the IG never picks its own mode: byte 5 becomes 0x31 (Operate) as soon as the\n  HOST commands Operate; --ig-mode only seeds it before the first IG Control",
   "originalText": "framing: [id 1B][size 1B][payload]    size = total bytes incl. header\n\nSOF   id 101 (0x65), 24 bytes\n  65 18 03 00 00 b5 00 80 <frame counter> 00 00 00 00 00 .. 00   the reference\n  65 18 03 00 00 30 00 80 <frame counter> 00 00 00 00 00 .. 00   this IG\n     |        |  |\n     |        |  +-- 0x00 0x80 at bytes 6-7: the byte-swap flag (little-endian)\n     |        +----- byte 5: IG mode (bits 0-1), timestamp-valid (2), earth\n     |                 model (3), CIGI minor version (4-7); 3.3 => 0x30\n     +-------------- byte 0: id (0x65), byte 1: size (0x18 = 24 bytes)\n  offset 8: the HOST's frame counter, echoed out of the IG Control it arrived in\n  offsets 12 / 16: timestamp and last-host-frame - left at 0 by the reference\n  Master, still 0 here, which is what keeps the SOF byte-identical\n  the IG never picks its own mode: byte 5 becomes 0x31 (Operate) as soon as the\n  HOST commands Operate; --ig-mode only seeds it before the first IG Control",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "2MPE8BwZX5X4IkUHbluI",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 1090.0,
   "width": 581.25,
   "height": 125.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 310838796,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 352054171,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "HAT/HOT Request  ->  Response            id 102, 16 B: Height double @ 8\n  types 0 (HAT) / 1 (HOT)\n                 ->  Extended Response   id 103, 40 B: HAT @ 8, HOT @ 16\n  type 2 (extended)\nboth carry a 3-byte reserved gap after the flags byte, which is what aligns\nthe first double to an 8-byte boundary. CIGI 3.2 packed them straight after\nthe flags: the HOST then read HOT out of the material-code bytes - zero -\nand flew the aircraft down to the terrain.",
   "originalText": "HAT/HOT Request  ->  Response            id 102, 16 B: Height double @ 8\n  types 0 (HAT) / 1 (HOT)\n                 ->  Extended Response   id 103, 40 B: HAT @ 8, HOT @ 16\n  type 2 (extended)\nboth carry a 3-byte reserved gap after the flags byte, which is what aligns\nthe first double to an 8-byte boundary. CIGI 3.2 packed them straight after\nthe flags: the HOST then read HOT out of the material-code bytes - zero -\nand flew the aircraft down to the terrain.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "b4hGQ4TPXa1xextnIjMN",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 1265.0,
   "width": 897.615,
   "height": 33.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 532908975,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 271709218,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "HAT = request altitude - HOT, which is what catches the two doubles packed in the wrong place. Valid is set only when a terrain source could\nanswer.",
   "originalText": "HAT = request altitude - HOT, which is what catches the two doubles packed in the wrong place. Valid is set only when a terrain source could\nanswer.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
  {
   "id": "guFg31UeyqNtPhwE6FhJ",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 1330.0,
   "width": 876.825,
   "height": 33.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1114428810,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 530486112,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Pacing uses timeBeginPeriod(1): Windows' default 15.6 ms (~64 Hz) timer granularity otherwise caps any rate above ~60 Hz at ~64 with an\noccasional burst - worth knowing when comparing rates with another tool.",
   "originalText": "Pacing uses timeBeginPeriod(1): Windows' default 15.6 ms (~64 Hz) timer granularity otherwise caps any rate above ~60 Hz at ~64 with an\noccasional burst - worth knowing when comparing rates with another tool.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
  {
   "id": "1wR0D6LwfeXfZFXtqWQo",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 1410.0,
   "width": 934.875,
   "height": 33.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 361510668,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 697936531,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "In Host-Master.pcapng the counter advances ~0.52 per SOF (~53 Hz) while the SOF rate was ~100 Hz (an 8/12 ms alternation): the Master asked for\nabout twice the replies the HOST had frames to give.",
   "originalText": "In Host-Master.pcapng the counter advances ~0.52 per SOF (~53 Hz) while the SOF rate was ~100 Hz (an 8/12 ms alternation): the Master asked for\nabout twice the replies the HOST had frames to give.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
