   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "1 - Prepar3D's own terrain, through PdkTerrainProbe.dll\nISurfaceQueryManagerV400, a free-standing query: the surface the sim will place the aircraft on, so runway flattening and any added scenery\nare included and nothing has to be pre-mapped",
   "originalText": "1 - Prepar3D's own terrain, through PdkTerrainProbe.dll\nISurfaceQueryManagerV400, a free-standing query: the surface the sim will place the aircraft on, so runway flattening and any added scenery are included and nothing has to be pre-mapped",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r13CqjIOrovjJXhrsKDO",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
