   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "2 - the SRTM terrain database, offline .hgt tiles\nanswered from latitude and longitude alone, so it stays correct for the whole flight, but it is a copy of the world: no flattening, no changed\nscenery",
   "originalText": "2 - the SRTM terrain database, offline .hgt tiles\nanswered from latitude and longitude alone, so it stays correct for the whole flight, but it is a copy of the world: no flattening, no changed scenery",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "nBwPvd7zUlarJSqivLPN",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
