  {
   "id": "eUUPQGRIX2tENf2GHMuF",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 1150.0,
   "width": 643.25,
   "height": 171.875,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 682761338,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1418537752,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "HOT   = the height from the first source that can answer\nHAT   = test-point altitude - HOT\n        entity-relative: the HOST aircraft's altitude (Entity Control) - the\n                         request's Z offset   (+Z points down; entity axes are NED)\n        geodetic:        the request carries its own altitude\nValid = 0 - never a fabricated 0 m - when no source can cover the point: an\n        entity other than the ownship (0), an entity-relative request with no\n        anchor, or a point no source can reach\nupdatePeriod = 0 -> answered once;  n -> re-answered every n-th frame until a\n        fresh request with the same HAT/HOT ID replaces it (answered at once)\nthe geodetic FSUIPC fallback is accepted only within 500 m of the aircraft",
   "originalText": "HOT   = the height from the first source that can answer\nHAT   = test-point altitude - HOT\n        entity-relative: the HOST aircraft's altitude (Entity Control) - the\n                         request's Z offset   (+Z points down; entity axes are NED)\n        geodetic:        the request carries its own altitude\nValid = 0 - never a fabricated 0 m - when no source can cover the point: an\n        entity other than the ownship (0), an entity-relative request with no\n        anchor, or a point no source can reach\nupdatePeriod = 0 -> answered once;  n -> re-answered every n-th frame until a\n        fresh request with the same HAT/HOT ID replaces it (answered at once)\nthe geodetic FSUIPC fallback is accepted only within 500 m of the aircraft",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "vxleJ3ZlWq9893HH3yOg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 1330.0,
   "width": 635.5,
   "height": 93.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1987505720,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1308579939,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ANCHOR   entity-relative answers are anchored to the HOST's own Entity Control\n         (entity 0) - the pose its flight model is commanding - not to the sim's\n         FSUIPC read-back. All-zero and off-globe poses are refused, not adopted.\n         The six probe offsets are identical wherever the aircraft is, so a stuck\n         anchor is invisible on the wire: on the rig it parked the aircraft on the\n         departure ground, a ~550 ft step at the destination.",
   "originalText": "ANCHOR   entity-relative answers are anchored to the HOST's own Entity Control\n         (entity 0) - the pose its flight model is commanding - not to the sim's\n         FSUIPC read-back. All-zero and off-globe poses are refused, not adopted.\n         The six probe offsets are identical wherever the aircraft is, so a stuck\n         anchor is invisible on the wire: on the rig it parked the aircraft on the\n         departure ground, a ~550 ft step at the destination.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "nbDpnBG2HiGnY3rX3TFi",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 1465.0,
   "width": 935.5500000000001,
   "height": 50.625,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1200201591,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1457048778,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "--terrain-offset applies to the database only: a height from the sim needs no calibration, and applying it would correct it twice. Entity-relative\nanswers are given at the HOST's aircraft position - the reference capture's six points sit within 10.4 m of it, far below any terrain source's resolution\n- and the sim is still asked for the exact point.",
   "originalText": "--terrain-offset applies to the database only: a height from the sim needs no calibration, and applying it would correct it twice. Entity-relative\nanswers are given at the HOST's aircraft position - the reference capture's six points sit within 10.4 m of it, far below any terrain source's resolution\n- and the sim is still asked for the exact point.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
