   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "1 - EVENTID_Frame, Prepar3D's per-frame event (IEventServiceV510/V600)\nonce per rendered frame: the tick of a running sim. v5 keeps signalling it while paused; the rig's v6 does not - pausing stops the frame loop\ntoo.",
   "originalText": "1 - EVENTID_Frame, Prepar3D's per-frame event (IEventServiceV510/V600)\nonce per rendered frame: the tick of a running sim. v5 keeps signalling it while paused; the rig's v6 does not - pausing stops the frame loop too.",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "DRVAj5ujTGcEadgwL2TS",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
