  {
   "id": "bgzfkI3qbcVeWMHhU925",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 1200.0,
   "width": 864.0,
   "height": 33.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 719221167,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1540254054,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "A running sim never reaches the thread, so the one call made outside Prepar3D's thread can only happen while Prepar3D's own loop has\nstopped - which is what the rig does for the whole session. The object-tick lifecycle fault (a reposition stranding the tick) is gone with it.",
   "originalText": "A running sim never reaches the thread, so the one call made outside Prepar3D's thread can only happen while Prepar3D's own loop has\nstopped - which is what the rig does for the whole session. The object-tick lifecycle fault (a reposition stranding the tick) is gone with it.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
  {
   "id": "jt9EpuT5DSpzpG32uAcF",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 1265.0,
   "width": 565.75,
   "height": 218.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 535198799,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1279231460,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "diag word   (bit 31 kPresent must be set; a 0 means \"no diagnosis\")\n  0..7    user-object create callbacks      (saturate at 255)\n  8..15   removals of the tick's object\n 16..23   RegisterSimulation failures\n 24       a simulation is bound\n 25       the bound object was the user object then\n 26       a user-object create was ignored (already bound)\n 27       the newest pass came from the ADD-ON'S OWN THREAD\n 31       the word is filled\ntail        frameTicks  frame-event callbacks seen\n            simEvents   bit 0 paused now; sticky pause/unpause, sim\n                        stop/start, scenario load, vehicle change, frozen\n            simMode     GetMode() at the last object tick\n            frameFails  frame-event registration failures",
   "originalText": "diag word   (bit 31 kPresent must be set; a 0 means \"no diagnosis\")\n  0..7    user-object create callbacks      (saturate at 255)\n  8..15   removals of the tick's object\n 16..23   RegisterSimulation failures\n 24       a simulation is bound\n 25       the bound object was the user object then\n 26       a user-object create was ignored (already bound)\n 27       the newest pass came from the ADD-ON'S OWN THREAD\n 31       the word is filled\ntail        frameTicks  frame-event callbacks seen\n            simEvents   bit 0 paused now; sticky pause/unpause, sim\n                        stop/start, scenario load, vehicle change, frozen\n            simMode     GetMode() at the last object tick\n            frameFails  frame-event registration failures",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "lCmXhLELyEHbF8nyUcHD",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2360.0,
   "y": 1505.0,
   "width": 511.5,
   "height": 62.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1684920351,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 301266347,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "ticks advancing + bit 27      normal for a paused sim, not a fault\nticks frozen, frameTicks > 0  the whole add-on has stopped running\nticks frozen, frameTicks = 0  no frame event was ever delivered\nalive clear                   no surface service at all",
   "originalText": "ticks advancing + bit 27      normal for a paused sim, not a fault\nticks frozen, frameTicks > 0  the whole add-on has stopped running\nticks frozen, frameTicks = 0  no frame event was ever delivered\nalive clear                   no surface service at all",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
