   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "6 - Shared-memory contract (src\\TerrainProbeIpc.h)",
   "originalText": "6 - Shared-memory contract (src\\TerrainProbeIpc.h)",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 19
  },
  {
   "id": "kHr6xfqk76cnT1OZTJh5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 1710.0,
   "width": 604.5,
   "height": 296.875,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 960775722,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1180470744,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "mapping  Local\\CigiStarter.TerrainProbe.v1   (session-local: both sides run in\n         the logged-on user's session, so Global\\ would need elevation)\nmagic 'PTBP' (0x50425450)    version 2    capacity 256 slots\n\nheader (48 B)\n  magic - version - capacity - tickRateHz\n  alive       1 while a service and a tick exist\n  lastError   the last HRESULT the probe saw\n  probePid    Prepar3D's pid (what tasklist /m finds)\n  ticks       heartbeat: advances while the probe runs\n  reqSeq      bumped by the IG once it has written queries[]\n  rspSeq      seqlock over results[]: odd while rows are rewritten\n  queryFails  points Prepar3D has refused\n  diag        the diagnostic word (0 = an older add-on)\nqueries[256] x 32 B   the IG writes:  latDeg lonDeg altMeters key enabled\nresults[256] x 48 B   the probe writes: latDeg lonDeg hotMeters key status\n                      materialCode nrmAzimuthDeg nrmElevationDeg\ntail (16 B)           frameTicks simEvents simMode frameFails\nsizeof(Shared) = 48 + 256*(32+48) + 16 = 20528 B",
   "originalText": "mapping  Local\\CigiStarter.TerrainProbe.v1   (session-local: both sides run in\n         the logged-on user's session, so Global\\ would need elevation)\nmagic 'PTBP' (0x50425450)    version 2    capacity 256 slots\n\nheader (48 B)\n  magic - version - capacity - tickRateHz\n  alive       1 while a service and a tick exist\n  lastError   the last HRESULT the probe saw\n  probePid    Prepar3D's pid (what tasklist /m finds)\n  ticks       heartbeat: advances while the probe runs\n  reqSeq      bumped by the IG once it has written queries[]\n  rspSeq      seqlock over results[]: odd while rows are rewritten\n  queryFails  points Prepar3D has refused\n  diag        the diagnostic word (0 = an older add-on)\nqueries[256] x 32 B   the IG writes:  latDeg lonDeg altMeters key enabled\nresults[256] x 48 B   the probe writes: latDeg lonDeg hotMeters key status\n                      materialCode nrmAzimuthDeg nrmElevationDeg\ntail (16 B)           frameTicks simEvents simMode frameFails\nsizeof(Shared) = 48 + 256*(32+48) + 16 = 20528 B",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "Qcw949SD18GO7c97529m",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 2075.0,
   "width": 620.0,
   "height": 109.375,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1396793570,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1398451084,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "1  the IG writes queries[i] (enabled, with its own key), then bumps reqSeq\n2  the probe walks the table on its next tick, asks the surface query for every\n   enabled point and writes results[], the batch guarded by rspSeq\n3  the IG accepts a row when status = Ok, the key matches and the echoed lat/lon\n   still match the point it asked about\n   -> a one-tick-old answer is safe; a request that has moved is refused and\n      falls back, never answered with somebody else's terrain",
   "originalText": "1  the IG writes queries[i] (enabled, with its own key), then bumps reqSeq\n2  the probe walks the table on its next tick, asks the surface query for every\n   enabled point and writes results[], the batch guarded by rspSeq\n3  the IG accepts a row when status = Ok, the key matches and the echoed lat/lon\n   still match the point it asked about\n   -> a one-tick-old answer is safe; a request that has moved is refused and\n      falls back, never answered with somebody else's terrain",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12.5
  },
  {
   "id": "EdsfkPernasNPcE7qe4S",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 2205.0,
   "width": 921.375,
   "height": 50.625,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1562739641,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1173660813,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "pack(8) plus a static_assert on every size and offset: a differently packed build would agree on slot 0 and misread every slot after it, so a layout\nchange must bump kVersion. The table is metric - the wire is metres and only the probe converts to the PDK's radians and feet. 256 slots because\nTerrainBaker fills the whole table to bake a tile in seconds.",
   "originalText": "pack(8) plus a static_assert on every size and offset: a differently packed build would agree on slot 0 and misread every slot after it, so a layout\nchange must bump kVersion. The table is metric - the wire is metres and only the probe converts to the PDK's radians and feet. 256 slots because\nTerrainBaker fills the whole table to bake a tile in seconds.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
  {
   "id": "kJOHLIpF0dIwoIzDfpca",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 120.0,
   "y": 2310.0,
   "width": 938.7900000000001,
   "height": 33.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 887997245,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 828579184,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "The contract test overrides the mapping name on purpose: sharing it would make its first memset wipe a live add-on's header, which then reads as a\nprobe that is loaded but has stopped answering.",
   "originalText": "The contract test overrides the mapping name on purpose: sharing it would make its first memset wipe a live add-on's header, which then reads as a\nprobe that is loaded but has stopped answering.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13.5
  },
