  {
   "id": "Jhia0yf9SFOAQKvG8wfV",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 1710.0,
   "width": 491.03999999999996,
   "height": 405.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1463839826,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1269721962,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "text": "+----------------------------------------------------------------+\n| HOST 192.168.70.2:8001  ->  SOF destination                    |\n| IG   :8000   (this IG is 192.168.70.70)                        |\n|                                                                |\n| Stream    : RUNNING (paced to the HOST)                        |\n| SOF rate  : 150 Hz requested, 150/s measured                   |\n| SOF frames: 101                                                |\n| Received  : 0 datagrams (0/s), 0 entity updates                |\n| IG mode   : 0 (Standby)  <- commanded by the HOST              |\n| HOST frame: 0                                                  |\n|                                                                |\n| Relay     : 4 clients, 4 reachable, 1567 datagrams forwarded   |\n| Relay NIC : Killer E2600 Gigabit Ethernet Controller           |\n|                                                                |\n| TerrainDB : 2 tile(s), 1 in memory, 25 MB                      |\n| HAT/HOT   : answering from the sim's own terrain               |\n| Probe     : sim paused; the probe is answering from its own    |\n|             thread                                             |\n| Anchor    : HOST Entity Control -6.53973, 106.75963, 576 ft    |\n| Terrain   : 89 ft ground under the sim aircraft, 99 ft sim     |\n|             aircraft                                           |\n|                                                                |\n| [x] Answer HAT/HOT              SOF rate: [ 150 ] Hz [ Apply ] |\n| [x] Pace SOF to HOST replies (flow control)                    |\n|                                                                |\n| [ START ]  [ STOP ]                                   [ EXIT ] |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+",
   "originalText": "+----------------------------------------------------------------+\n| HOST 192.168.70.2:8001  ->  SOF destination                    |\n| IG   :8000   (this IG is 192.168.70.70)                        |\n|                                                                |\n| Stream    : RUNNING (paced to the HOST)                        |\n| SOF rate  : 150 Hz requested, 150/s measured                   |\n| SOF frames: 101                                                |\n| Received  : 0 datagrams (0/s), 0 entity updates                |\n| IG mode   : 0 (Standby)  <- commanded by the HOST              |\n| HOST frame: 0                                                  |\n|                                                                |\n| Relay     : 4 clients, 4 reachable, 1567 datagrams forwarded   |\n| Relay NIC : Killer E2600 Gigabit Ethernet Controller           |\n|                                                                |\n| TerrainDB : 2 tile(s), 1 in memory, 25 MB                      |\n| HAT/HOT   : answering from the sim's own terrain               |\n| Probe     : sim paused; the probe is answering from its own    |\n|             thread                                             |\n| Anchor    : HOST Entity Control -6.53973, 106.75963, 576 ft    |\n| Terrain   : 89 ft ground under the sim aircraft, 99 ft sim     |\n|             aircraft                                           |\n|                                                                |\n| [x] Answer HAT/HOT              SOF rate: [ 150 ] Hz [ Apply ] |\n| [x] Pace SOF to HOST replies (flow control)                    |\n|                                                                |\n| [ START ]  [ STOP ]                                   [ EXIT ] |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------+",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "bPqphy4p8tMRKRKltVIa",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 2120.0,
   "width": 919.7500000000001,
   "height": 48.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 2088295849,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 61315191,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Refreshes 4x/s. START / STOP start and stop the SOF stream (the button that would be a no-op is the disabled one). Answer HAT/HOT also starts and\nstops the FSUIPC poller: off means no FSUIPC calls at all. Pace SOF to HOST replies is the flow-control switch. SOF rate is 1..100000 Hz, applied to\nthe transmit loop on the next frame with Apply or Enter, so the stream retunes while it runs; --fps only seeds it.",
   "originalText": "Refreshes 4x/s. START / STOP start and stop the SOF stream (the button that would be a no-op is the disabled one). Answer HAT/HOT also starts and\nstops the FSUIPC poller: off means no FSUIPC calls at all. Pace SOF to HOST replies is the flow-control switch. SOF rate is 1..100000 Hz, applied to\nthe transmit loop on the next frame with Apply or Enter, so the stream retunes while it runs; --fps only seeds it.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13
  },
  {
   "id": "v6VlTDLgpQEW8kM9G7QE",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 2215.0,
   "width": 921.96,
   "height": 48.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 242953873,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 144993589,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "EXIT is the only way out: SC_CLOSE is deleted from the system menu (the X is drawn greyed out), WM_CLOSE is ignored, and with no console Ctrl+C\ncannot reach it. The stream is already running when the window appears and the window minimises itself; --no-auto-start is the single way back to a\nwindow that waits for the button.",
   "originalText": "EXIT is the only way out: SC_CLOSE is deleted from the system menu (the X is drawn greyed out), WM_CLOSE is ignored, and with no console Ctrl+C\ncannot reach it. The stream is already running when the window appears and the window minimises itself; --no-auto-start is the single way back to a\nwindow that waits for the button.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13
  },
  {
   "id": "iaNHtjA8qbCMs8jyOOaC",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1240.0,
   "y": 2310.0,
   "width": 904.0200000000001,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "index": null,
   "seed": 1261134668,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 260891855,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "created": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Terrain lines: HAT/HOT names the source in force; TerrainDB the fallback behind it and its size; Probe the tick that is answering; Anchor the HOST's\npose; Terrain the sim's own aircraft over FSUIPC - the ground under it and its altitude in feet, the way Prepar3D shows them.",
   "originalText": "Terrain lines: HAT/HOT names the source in force; TerrainDB the fallback behind it and its size; Probe the tick that is answering; Anchor the HOST's\npose; Terrain the sim's own aircraft over FSUIPC - the ground under it and its altitude in feet, the way Prepar3D shows them.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseFontSize": 13
  },
