   "text": "FILES   src\\main.cpp  src\\SofPacer.h  src\\Gui.h/.cpp  src\\cigi.h/.cpp\n        src\\TerrainSource.h/.cpp   the FSUIPC poller thread\n        src\\TerrainDb.h/.cpp       the SRTM .hgt reader\n        src\\TerrainProbe.h/.cpp    this side of the shared-memory link\n        src\\TerrainProbeIpc.h      the pinned contract\n        src\\Relay.h/.cpp           client.txt, frames, Npcap, SendARP\n        src\\Version.h/.cpp         the build's own identity (git describe)\n        client.txt / terrain\\      optional inputs beside the exe\nBENCH   tools\\test-hathot-emulator.ps1 -Local [-Stop] -> PASS/FAIL\n        tools\\capture-hat-hot.ps1 [-Summary]\n        external\\HostEmulator_Win32_v3.3.3\\Hemu3.exe (Boeing TSS)\n        tools\\PdkTerrainProbe\\test\\PdkTerrainProbeTest.exe\n        tools\\TerrainBaker   plan / probe / survey / compose\n        captures need Npcap + Wireshark's dumpcap and tshark",
