   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "PdkTerrainProbe is deliberately not in the solution: it needs the sim's SDK, and a machine that only builds the IG should not be broken by that. The\nv5 and v6 DLLs are built separately and kept side by side in bin\\Release-v5 and bin\\Release-v6.",
   "originalText": "PdkTerrainProbe is deliberately not in the solution: it needs the sim's SDK, and a machine that only builds the IG should not be broken by that. The\nv5 and v6 DLLs are built separately and kept side by side in bin\\Release-v5 and bin\\Release-v6.",
